WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.810
The Previous scene and Next scene controls move you

00:00:02.889 --> 00:00:06.376
through one scene at a time The contents menu

00:00:06.389 --> 00:00:09.849
helps you return to a topic You can pause

00:00:09.915 --> 00:00:13.507
or replay the narration A play symbol beside a

00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:16.244
card or answer option lets you hear that particular

00:00:16.257 --> 00:00:20.507
explanation Listening to an answer option does not select

00:00:20.507 --> 00:00:23.007
it as your answer you make your choice using

00:00:23.073 --> 00:00:24.534
the separate answer control
